WEBVTT

00:01.115 --> 00:04.115
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:04.115 --> 00:10.048
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:10.048 --> 00:13.881
- You'll never get me secret
Krabby Patty formula, Plankton.
- 你永远不会让我知道秘密
蟹黄派配方，浮游生物。

00:13.881 --> 00:16.015
Adios.
再见。

00:16.015 --> 00:18.081
- Ahhhh!
- 啊啊啊！

00:18.081 --> 00:20.148
[groaning]
[呻吟]

00:20.148 --> 00:21.315
- Hmm?
- 唔？

00:21.315 --> 00:23.115
Plankton, you look like the
cheese
浮游生物，你看起来像
奶酪

00:23.115 --> 00:24.615
that fell off the cracker.
那是从饼干上掉下来的。

00:24.615 --> 00:28.315
I bet you tried to get that
formula again.
我打赌你尝试过得到那个
再次公式。

00:28.315 --> 00:29.881
- I don't get it.
- 我不明白。

00:29.881 --> 00:32.948
A crab's brain is smaller than
the point of a pencil,
螃蟹的大脑比
铅笔的尖端，

00:32.948 --> 00:35.748
but he keeps
outsmarting me.
但他保留
比我聪明。

00:35.748 --> 00:38.681
- [laughing and grunting]
- [大笑和咕哝]

00:41.915 --> 00:43.415
- To give up that formula,
- 放弃那个公式，

00:43.415 --> 00:46.115
Mr. Krabs would have to be as
dumb as Patrick.
螃蟹先生必须是这样的
像帕特里克一样愚蠢。

00:46.115 --> 00:51.448
- Hmm, yes, yes, he would,
- 嗯，是的，是的，他会的，

00:51.448 --> 00:53.548
as dumb as Patrick.
像帕特里克一样愚蠢。

00:53.548 --> 00:56.481
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

01:02.315 --> 01:04.848
[breathing deeply]
[深呼吸]

01:08.115 --> 01:11.848
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:14.715 --> 01:18.781
- One swab from the inside of
his cheek should do it.
- 从内部取出一根棉签
他的脸颊应该做到这一点。

01:18.781 --> 01:20.081
Ahhh!
啊啊！

01:20.081 --> 01:23.315
Nagging Neptune!
唠叨的海王星！

01:23.315 --> 01:25.848
Back,
you twisted tongue.
回来，
你扭曲了舌头。

01:25.848 --> 01:30.148
You will not lick me.
你不会舔我的。

01:30.148 --> 01:31.815
Ahh!
啊！

01:34.881 --> 01:36.648
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

01:36.648 --> 01:39.815
- Sweet gaseous molasses.
- 甜气态糖蜜。

01:39.815 --> 01:42.015
Yahhhh!
呀啊啊！

01:42.015 --> 01:44.048
Ehh-ehh-ehh!
诶诶诶！

01:44.048 --> 01:46.448
Ehh-ehh-ehh-ehh!
诶诶诶诶！

01:49.915 --> 01:52.315
- Augh, P.U.
- 啊，P.U.

01:52.315 --> 01:54.615
What's that awful stench?
那股恶臭是什么？

01:54.615 --> 01:57.948
You're not boiling your
underpants again, are you?
你没有煮沸你的
又穿内裤了，是吗？

01:57.948 --> 01:59.615
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:59.615 --> 02:03.048
- I told you to turn off that
laugh track.
- 我告诉过你把它关掉
笑声轨迹。

02:03.048 --> 02:05.681
And if you must know,
I made sauce,
如果你一定要知道的话
我做了酱汁，

02:05.681 --> 02:09.481
but when I add Patrick's DNA to
it,
但当我将帕特里克的DNA添加到
它，

02:09.481 --> 02:12.148
it will become salsa
imbecilicus.
它会变成莎莎酱
傻瓜。

02:12.148 --> 02:13.315
- Duuuhhhh.
- 呃呃呃。

02:13.315 --> 02:14.881
- Idiot sauce!
- 白痴酱！

02:14.881 --> 02:16.415
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

02:16.415 --> 02:18.948
I'll serve it to Krabs,
and it'll make him so dumb
我会把它送给螃蟹，
这会让他变得很愚蠢

02:18.948 --> 02:21.315
he'll just give me the secret
formula.
他只会告诉我秘密
公式。

02:21.315 --> 02:22.715
Huh? Huh?
啊？啊？

02:22.715 --> 02:25.415
- I think I prefer the boiling
underpants.
- 我想我更喜欢煮沸
内裤。

02:25.415 --> 02:27.315
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:27.315 --> 02:30.048
Let me do it.
You always make a mess.
让我来做吧。
你总是把事情搞得一团糟。

02:30.048 --> 02:31.648
- Leave me be, woman.
- 别管我了，女人。

02:31.648 --> 02:33.581
- Don't tell me...
- 别告诉我...

02:35.381 --> 02:38.215
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

02:38.215 --> 02:39.215
Augh.
啊啊。

02:39.215 --> 02:42.081
Oh, no.
Ehh! Ehh! Ehh!
哦，不。
呃！呃！呃！

02:42.081 --> 02:43.115
Augh.
[farts]
啊啊。
[放屁]

02:43.115 --> 02:48.515
[mumbling gibberish]
[咕哝着胡言乱语]

02:58.115 --> 02:59.915
[thunder booming]
[雷霆轰鸣]

02:59.915 --> 03:01.181
[rain pattering]
[淅淅沥沥的雨声]

03:01.181 --> 03:05.181
all: [mumbling gibberish]
全体：[咕哝着胡言乱语]

03:05.181 --> 03:06.515
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

03:06.515 --> 03:09.715
all: [mumbling gibberish]
全体：[咕哝着胡言乱语]

03:16.881 --> 03:18.381
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:18.381 --> 03:19.315
Huh.
呵呵。

03:19.315 --> 03:24.215
- [laughing
- [笑

03:24.215 --> 03:29.315
I've got the best
taste in town...duh...
我已经拥有最好的
城里的味道……呃……

03:29.315 --> 03:30.715
- I never thought that folks
around here
- 我从没想过人们
在这附近

03:30.715 --> 03:33.148
were particularly bright,
but this morning,
都特别明亮，
但今天早上，

03:33.148 --> 03:35.681
everyone seems as
dumb as traffic cones.
每个人看起来都像
像交通锥一样愚蠢。

03:35.681 --> 03:40.081
- [mumbling gibberish]
- [咕哝着胡言乱语]

03:40.081 --> 03:44.515
- [mumbling gibberish]
- [咕哝着胡言乱语]

03:44.515 --> 03:46.515
- What happened to your head,
SpongeBob?
- 你的头怎么了
海绵宝宝？

03:46.515 --> 03:49.315
- Uh...
me make Krabby Patties.
- 呃...
我做蟹黄饼。

03:49.315 --> 03:50.981
- Uh, that's mud.
- 呃，那是泥巴。

03:50.981 --> 03:54.048
- [mumbling gibberish]
- [咕哝着胡言乱语]

03:54.048 --> 03:55.048
[farts]
[放屁]

03:55.048 --> 03:56.781
[mumbling gibberish]
[咕哝着胡言乱语]

03:56.781 --> 04:00.048
all: [mumbling gibberish]
全体：[咕哝着胡言乱语]

04:00.048 --> 04:01.948
- [laughing and grunting]
- [大笑和咕哝]

04:01.948 --> 04:04.348
- Hey, Patrick, have you noticed
that everyone's acting
- 嘿，帕特里克，你注意到了吗
每个人都在表演

04:04.348 --> 04:05.948
a lot like you today?
今天很像你吗？

04:05.948 --> 04:08.348
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

04:08.348 --> 04:10.515
[balloon pops and hisses]
[气球爆裂并发出嘶嘶声]

04:10.515 --> 04:13.315
I don't understand
the question.
我不明白
的问题。

04:13.315 --> 04:18.081
[laughing and grunting]
[大笑和咕哝]

04:18.081 --> 04:21.015
- [laughing]
- [笑]

04:24.315 --> 04:26.381
[gulps and burps]
[吞咽和打嗝]

04:26.381 --> 04:28.581
- What in Sam Hill?
- 山姆希尔有什么？

04:28.581 --> 04:32.315
both: [mumbling gibberish]
两人：[咕哝着胡言乱语]

04:32.315 --> 04:34.648
- [mumbling gibberish]
- [咕哝着胡言乱语]

04:34.648 --> 04:37.181
- [mumbling gibberish]
- [咕哝着胡言乱语]

04:37.181 --> 04:38.648
Ow...ow.
噢……噢。

04:38.648 --> 04:40.215
all: [mumbling gibberish]
全体：[咕哝着胡言乱语]

04:40.215 --> 04:42.381
Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！

04:42.381 --> 04:45.548
- Hey, don't do that.
- 嘿，别那样做。

04:45.548 --> 04:46.615
[together]
Ow!
[一起]
噢！

04:46.615 --> 04:49.348
[mumbling gibberish]
[咕哝着胡言乱语]

04:49.348 --> 04:51.315
- Lining up for the Chum Bucket?
- 排队领取密友桶？

04:51.315 --> 04:54.548
Now I know everyone's got a hole
in their screen door.
现在我知道每个人都有一个洞
在他们的纱门里。

04:54.548 --> 04:57.015
This place is ground zero for
zeroes.
这个地方是归零地
零。

04:57.015 --> 05:02.448
Zero as being everyone's
collective IQ.
零是每个人的
集体智商。

05:02.448 --> 05:04.448
- Ahh!
- 啊！

05:04.448 --> 05:07.848
Ow!
噢！

05:07.848 --> 05:11.315
- And that's how the idiot sauce
spread throughout Bikini Bottom.
- 这就是白痴酱的做法
遍布整个比基尼泳裤。

05:11.315 --> 05:13.648
I guess you weren't affected
because you were protected
我猜你没有受到影响
因为你受到了保护

05:13.648 --> 05:15.315
by your treedome.
在你的树顶旁。

05:15.315 --> 05:17.448
- And you weren't affected
because you're a computer.
- 而你并没有受到影响
因为你是一台电脑。

05:17.448 --> 05:20.848
Looks like it's up to us to find
a cure for the town's idiocy.
看来我们要找到
治愈小镇愚蠢行为的良药

05:20.848 --> 05:23.648
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:23.648 --> 05:25.915
You not Plankton.
你不是浮游生物。

05:25.915 --> 05:28.881
Me Plankton.
我是浮游生物。

05:28.881 --> 05:30.615
- We need to snap him out of
this.
-我们需要把他救出来
这个。

05:30.615 --> 05:32.381
What's the opposite of dim?
昏暗的反义词是什么？

05:32.381 --> 05:33.648
- Bright?
- 明亮的？

05:33.648 --> 05:35.481
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

05:35.481 --> 05:36.815
- It's not working.
- 它不起作用。

05:36.815 --> 05:38.515
Maybe we can feed him something
for brain food.
也许我们可以给他吃点东西
为健脑食品。

05:38.515 --> 05:40.915
You're smart.
What do you eat?
你很聪明。
你吃什么？

05:40.915 --> 05:43.315
- Nuts.
- 坚果。

05:43.315 --> 05:46.948
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

05:46.948 --> 05:48.315
- Oh, it doesn't seem to be
working.
-哦，好像不是
工作。

05:48.315 --> 05:50.481
You know him; how do you get him
to change?
你认识他；你怎么得到他
改变？

05:50.481 --> 05:52.315
- I usually just yell at him.
- 我通常只是对他大喊大叫。

05:52.315 --> 05:53.681
Get smart, dummy!
聪明点吧，笨蛋！

05:53.681 --> 05:55.948
- Wise up!
- Be clever, idiot!
- 聪明起来！
- 聪明一点，白痴！

05:55.948 --> 05:57.381
- Know things!
- 知道事情！

05:57.381 --> 06:01.648
- [laughs]
- [笑]

06:01.648 --> 06:03.715
- [sighs]
It's no use.
- [叹气]
这是没有用的。

06:03.715 --> 06:05.481
Being smart takes work.
聪明需要努力。

06:05.481 --> 06:08.848
- [gasps]
That gives me an idea.
- [喘气]
这给了我一个想法。

06:08.848 --> 06:12.648
Come one, come all to Bikini
Bottom University,
来吧，都来比基尼吧
底层大学，

06:12.648 --> 06:14.948
a free education for all.
全民免费教育。

06:14.948 --> 06:17.681
There's no more excuse for
being a dope.
没有更多的借口了
是个瘾君子。

06:17.681 --> 06:20.581
Step right up, all
you morons.
全部站起来
你们这些白痴。

06:20.581 --> 06:22.748
Classes are now
beginning.
现在上课了
开始。

06:22.748 --> 06:26.548
Aww, this isn't working.
- Try jiggling the keys.
哇哦，这行不通。
- 尝试摇动按键。

06:26.548 --> 06:29.215
[keys clanging]
[琴键叮当作响]

06:29.215 --> 06:31.048
all: [gasp]
全体：[喘气]

06:31.048 --> 06:35.315
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

06:35.315 --> 06:36.615
- G'mornin' students.
- 早安，学生们。

06:36.615 --> 06:38.315
Ehh...
呃...

06:38.315 --> 06:39.648
all: [speaking gibberish]
全体：[胡言乱语]

06:39.648 --> 06:41.815
- A whole school full of
Patricks?
- 整个学校充满了
帕特里克斯？

06:41.815 --> 06:44.215
Looks like we've got our work
cut out for us.
看起来我们已经完成工作了
为我们剪下来。

06:44.215 --> 06:47.215
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

06:47.215 --> 06:55.148
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:57.981 --> 06:59.115
[bell dings]
[铃声]

07:06.581 --> 07:07.915
[bell dings]
[铃声]

07:10.781 --> 07:14.115
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

07:16.115 --> 07:18.915
- And don't forget your last
homework assignment.
- 别忘了你的最后一次
家庭作业。

07:18.915 --> 07:20.748
- Looks like we were able to
educate
- 看来我们能够
教育

07:20.748 --> 07:22.915
the whole town in one semester.
一学期走遍整个城镇。

07:22.915 --> 07:25.415
- Yep, day after tomorrow is
graduation.
- 是的，后天是
毕业。

07:25.415 --> 07:26.948
And everybody learned
so well.
而且大家都学会了
太好了。

07:26.948 --> 07:28.915
- Everybody but one.
- 除了一个人之外的所有人。

07:30.181 --> 07:31.548
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

07:31.548 --> 07:34.048
Yeah.
- School is dumb?
是的。
- 学校很蠢？

07:34.048 --> 07:36.648
You misspelled every word.
你每个字都拼错了。

07:36.648 --> 07:38.315
- Shut up, dweeb.
- 闭嘴，呆子。

07:38.315 --> 07:39.415
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:39.415 --> 07:41.481
- Cookbooks, eh?
- 食谱，嗯？

07:41.481 --> 07:43.581
You holding out on
me, Krabs?
你坚持
我，蟹蟹？

07:43.581 --> 07:46.481
- I don't know what you're
talking about, Plankton.
-我不知道你是什么
谈论，浮游生物。

07:46.481 --> 07:49.315
Leave me alone.
请别打扰我。

07:49.315 --> 07:52.181
- I know you're cooking up
something special
- 我知道你在做饭
特别的东西

07:52.181 --> 07:53.848
in Home Ec, Eugene.
在 Home Ec，尤金。

07:53.848 --> 07:55.648
I want that formula!
我想要那个公式！

07:55.648 --> 07:57.981
- Um, Plankton,
can I come out now?
- 嗯，浮游生物，
我现在可以出来吗？

07:57.981 --> 08:01.081
- Did you finish my homework for
me, nerd?
- 你完成我的作业了吗
我，书呆子？

08:01.081 --> 08:02.315
- Yeah.
- 是的。

08:06.981 --> 08:09.015
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:09.015 --> 08:10.881
You know, you really ought to do
your own homework.
你知道，你真的应该这样做
你自己的作业。

08:10.881 --> 08:12.448
It's the only way you'll
learn.
这是你唯一的方法
学习。

08:12.448 --> 08:14.381
- I'll never learn!
- 我永远学不会！

08:14.381 --> 08:16.481
Uh...ahh!
呃……啊！

08:16.481 --> 08:17.781
Augh!
啊啊！

08:17.781 --> 08:20.148
Not again!
Augh!
不会再有！
啊啊！

08:22.515 --> 08:26.648
- This is a proud day for
everyone in Bikini Bottom.
- 这是值得骄傲的一天
比基尼泳裤里的每个人。

08:26.648 --> 08:29.048
And as a treat,
Squidward will play
作为一种款待，
章鱼哥会玩

08:29.048 --> 08:32.481
"Pomp and
Circumstance" on the clarinet.
“盛况和
单簧管上的情况”。

08:32.481 --> 08:33.648
[clarinet squawking]
[单簧管的嘎嘎声]

08:33.648 --> 08:36.848
all: [groaning]
全体：[呻吟]

08:38.515 --> 08:40.281
- Mm. Mmm.
[chuckles]
- 毫米。嗯。
[笑声]

08:40.281 --> 08:42.515
- Hurry up, Mr. Krabs; they're
handing out the diplomas.
- 快点，蟹老板；他们是
颁发文凭。

08:42.515 --> 08:44.048
- Just a minute.
- 等一下。

08:44.048 --> 08:47.481
I think I've perfected the
Krabby Patty formula.
我想我已经完善了
蟹黄饼配方。

08:47.481 --> 08:50.315
[gulps]
[吞咽]

08:50.315 --> 08:52.148
Yes.
That's it!
是的。
就是这样！

08:52.148 --> 08:56.248
- Great.
Well, see you out there.
- 伟大的。
好吧，到时候见。

08:56.248 --> 08:58.548
- Something smells good.
- 有什么东西闻起来很香。

08:58.548 --> 09:00.948
- [gasps]
P-P-P-P-Plankton?
- [喘气]
P-P-P-P-浮游生物？

09:00.948 --> 09:02.448
What are you
doing here?
你是什么
在这里做什么？

09:02.448 --> 09:04.681
- It's the last day of school,
baby.
- 今天是学校的最后一天
宝贝。

09:04.681 --> 09:06.448
No need to be formal.
不需要很正式。

09:06.448 --> 09:09.515
Call me Sheldon.
叫我谢尔顿。

09:09.515 --> 09:11.348
Great Neptune!
伟大的海王星！

09:11.348 --> 09:12.948
That's perfection!
这就是完美！

09:12.948 --> 09:15.515
Whoa, with this recipe,
I could own
哇，有了这个食谱，
我可以拥有

09:15.515 --> 09:18.981
the most popular fast-food
restaurant in Bikini Bottom.
最受欢迎的快餐
比基尼堡的餐厅。

09:18.981 --> 09:20.781
- No, please.
Not that.
- No, please.
不是那样的。

09:20.781 --> 09:22.115
Anything but that.
除了那个之外什么都可以。

09:22.115 --> 09:25.348
- Hand over that secret formula,
Krabs.
- 交出那个秘密配方，
螃蟹。

09:25.348 --> 09:28.348
all: Hooray!
全体：万岁！

09:28.348 --> 09:29.815
- Congratulations, SpongeBob.
- 恭喜你，海绵宝宝。

09:29.815 --> 09:31.448
You're smart now.
你现在很聪明了。

09:31.448 --> 09:34.515
It's funny that Mr. Krabs never
showed up to get his diploma.
有趣的是，蟹老板从来没有
来领取他的文凭。

09:34.515 --> 09:36.481
- Yeah, the only two people who
didn't show up
- 是的，只有两个人
没有出现

09:36.481 --> 09:38.048
are Mr. Krabs and Plankton.
是蟹老板和浮游生物。

09:38.048 --> 09:41.648
[gasps]
Let me have that diploma.
[喘气]
让我拥有那张文凭。

09:41.648 --> 09:42.881
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:42.881 --> 09:45.381
- Hey, no running in the halls.
- 嘿，不要在大厅里奔跑。

09:45.381 --> 09:46.648
- Eee-eee-eee-eee.
- 呃-呃-呃-呃。

09:46.648 --> 09:50.348
- Here you go, Plankton.
- 给你，浮游生物。

09:50.348 --> 09:52.781
- Mr. Krabs, your diploma.
- 蟹老板，你的文凭。

09:54.648 --> 09:57.815
- Thanks to this here diploma,
I'm suddenly smart enough
- 感谢这里的文凭，
我突然变得足够聪明了

09:57.815 --> 10:00.381
to never give you me secret
formula.
永远不会给你秘密
公式。

10:00.381 --> 10:01.681
- What?
- 什么？

10:01.681 --> 10:03.081
If I knew education worked like
that,
如果我知道教育就像
那个，

10:03.081 --> 10:05.581
I would have bought a
diploma years ago.
我本来会买一个
几年前的文凭。

10:05.581 --> 10:08.848
- Of course it doesn't work like
that, you microscopic meathead.
- 当然它不是这样工作的
那个，你这个微小的笨蛋。

10:08.848 --> 10:12.681
I took accelerated classes and
graduated months ago.
我参加了加速课程并且
几个月前毕业了。

10:12.681 --> 10:15.315
This diploma
is just a formality.
这个文凭
只是一种形式。

10:15.315 --> 10:18.548
- But--but you were just about
to give me the formula.
-但是-但是你刚刚
给我公式。

10:18.548 --> 10:20.848
You were scared of me.
你害怕我。

10:20.848 --> 10:24.315
- Excellent, Mr. Krabs.
- 太棒了，蟹老板。

10:24.315 --> 10:28.015
Here's your final grade for
acting class: A-plus.
这是您的最终成绩
表演等级：A+。

10:28.015 --> 10:29.815
I really felt the fear.
我确实感受到了恐惧。

10:29.815 --> 10:30.981
- Wait. What?
- 等待。什么？

10:30.981 --> 10:32.815
Acting class?
表演课？

10:32.815 --> 10:34.315
No!
不！

10:34.315 --> 10:38.315
- You've finally been schooled,
dropout.
- 你终于上学了
辍学。

10:38.315 --> 10:40.381
- Oof.
- 噢。

10:40.381 --> 10:42.781
Ahh!
啊！

10:42.781 --> 10:45.081
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:45.081 --> 10:47.081
- Come on, evil genius.
- 来吧，邪恶的天才。

10:47.081 --> 10:49.615
Time to start
your post-college years.
开始时间
你大学毕业后的岁月。

10:49.615 --> 10:51.815
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

10:55.348 --> 10:58.348
[Hawaiian music]
[夏威夷音乐]

10:58.348 --> 11:06.315
*
*
*
*

*